{"id":"en_the-whistleblower-s-debt","title":"The Whistleblower's Debt","titleEn":"The Whistleblower's Debt","description":"Six years earlier, bus driver Charles ran red lights to get a sick Su to safety. She repaid him by reporting him for a $20,000 reward, and the consequences stripped him of his license, his job and his home. Now Su has turned up at the firm where Charles's son Liam works as head of HR. Liam resists, but she goes public, forcing the company to give way and then using its own rules against his family. Digging into the old case, Liam uncovers forged signatures, a paid witness, erased dashcam footage and money trails. In the end, the weapon she wielded turns against her.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-whistleblowers-debt/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-whistleblowers-debt/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Good vs. Evil","Mystery","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcjoa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-whistleblower-s-debt_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcjoa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-whistleblower-s-debt_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcjoa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-whistleblower-s-debt_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcjoa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-whistleblower-s-debt_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"htt